{
  "title": "Human Influence Telemetry",
  "description": "An open documentary assurance method for evaluating whether human authority retained practical force in AI-mediated institutional decisions. Version 0.6.6 collects exploratory documentary applications, preserved advisory-model runs, research-boundary reviews, and tested stable-release preparation controls. It preserves normative contract 0.4.0, conformance engine 0.5.0, the bounded 0.6.0 human result, and Level 2 research maturity. The complete Ofqual draft remains AI-assessed and pending author adjudication. Publication does not establish current-contract replication, independent implementability, comparative benefit, or satisfaction of any v1 stable-release gate. The v0.6.5 claim-evidence audit remains version-bound and does not automatically cover the added research judgments.",
